차가 원칙입니다.","url":"http://xn--oy2bp0c4z1a85f.kr/sub06_1.php"},{"text":"환불기준","url":"http://xn--oy2bp0c4z1a85f.kr/sub06_1.php"},{"text":"예약취소시에는 입금하신 금액의 일정액만 환급이 됩니다.","url":"http://xn--oy2bp0c4z1a85f.kr/sub06_1.php"},{"text":"날씨예보에 의한 취소 신청 시 환불규정은 동일합니다.","url":"http://xn--oy2bp0c4z1a85f.kr/sub06_1.php"},{"text":"(천재지변, 태풍호우폭설 경보 및 주의보로 인한 취소제외)","url":"http://xn--oy2bp0c4z1a85f.kr/sub06_1.php"},{"text":"성수기에는 예약 완료 후 날짜 변경 불가합니다.","url":"http://xn--oy2bp0c4z1a85f.kr/sub06_1.php"},{"text":"사이트소개","url":"http://xn--oy2bp0c4z1a85f.kr/sub01_1.php"},{"text":"- 입실시간 : 오후 3시","url":"http://xn--oy2bp0c4z1a85f.kr/sub02_1.php"},{"text":"- 퇴실시간 : 오전 11시","url":"http://xn--oy2bp0c4z1a85f.kr/sub02_1.php"},{"text":"- 냉장고, 전자렌지, 전기레인지","url":"http://xn--oy2bp0c4z1a85f.kr/sub02_1.php"},{"text":"- 야외데크","url":"http://xn--oy2bp0c4z1a85f.kr/sub02_1.php"},{"text":"어닝이 설치된 야외데크","url":"http://xn--oy2bp0c4z1a85f.kr/sub02_1.php"}],"field_conditions":{"version":2,"status":"SURVEYED","parking":{"state":"UNKNOWN","mode":"UNKNOWN","tent_side":null,"cart_required":null,"shared_nearby":null,"drop_off_external":null,"auto_camping_sites":null},"shelter_setup":{"state":"UNKNOWN","max_tents":null,"max_tarps":null,"canopy_allowed":null,"note":null},"power":{"state":"SURVEYED","available":true,"limit_w":600,"regulatory_reference_w":null,"breaker_capacity":"2.7A","statutory_standard":false,"high_power_mention":true},"ground":{"state":"UNKNOWN","types":[]},"charcoal":{"state":"SURVEYED","allowed":true},"firewood":{"state":"SURVEYED","allowed":true,"sold":null},"fire_pit":{"state":"SURVEYED","arrangement":"개별"},"site_size":{"state":"UNKNOWN","groups":[]},"sanitary":{"state":"CONFIRMED","toilets_count":null,"showers_count":null,"sinks_count":null,"private_bathroom":true,"private_bathroom_state":"SURVEYED","hot_water":"제공","note":"단독 개별 화장실/욕실 구비"},"features":["TRAMPOLINE","TUBE_SLED","EXPERIENCE"],"rental_offers":[],"source":{"label":"한국관광공사 고캠핑 운영자 등록 및 공식 소개 전수조사","url":"https://www.gocamping.or.kr/b